  "title": "Fluffy Strawberry Fudge",
  "description": "Try this strawberry fudge for a break from ordinary chocolate fudge! All you&#39;ll need for this recipe is sugar, water, cream of tartar, strawberry preserves and egg whites.",
  "authors": [
    "HILARY2000"
  ],
